      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Google Maps Review Scraper & Filter for Cleanliness Complaints\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Workflow starts with a manual trigger to begin execution.\n2. Records from Airtable are searched and batch processed.\n3. Each batch is enriched with Google Maps data.\n4. Results are filtered, processed, and merged.\n5. Final data is updated back into Airtable.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Ensure Airtable credentials are set up for searching and updating records.\n- [ ] Configure the SerpApi key for accessing Google Maps data.\n- [ ] Check that field mappings in 'Edit Fields' nodes match desired data structure.\n\n### Customization\n\nThe fields edited or set in the 'Edit Fields' nodes can be customized to meet specific data processing needs. You can change the filter keywords in the Filter by Conditions node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
